      "title": "MOSS-Image Model & Turbo LoRA Link",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "#### Model Links:\n- **Diffusion Model (Default INT8)**:\n  [`moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- **Text Encoder (Default W4A8)**:\n  [`qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_moss_image_sft_w4a8_gptq.safetensors)\n- **VAE**:\n  [`flux2-vae.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/vae/moss_image_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\n#### ⚡ 8-Steps Turbo LoRA (optional):\n- [lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd/blob/main/lora.safetensors)\n- *Location*: `ComfyUI/models/loras/` *(Tip: Rename `lora.safetensors` to `moss_image_sft_8steps_dmd.safetensors`)*\n- *Usage*: steps is 8\n\n```text\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   ├── moss_image_base_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   │   ├── moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   └── moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │   └── lora.safetensors (or moss_image_sft_8steps_dmd.safetensors)\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├── qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors\n│   │   └── qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\nSimplified workflow by [HissingCat](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd/blob/main/lora.safetensors), based on Kijai's workflow."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "#### Model Links:\n- **Diffusion Model (Default INT8)**:\n  [`moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- **Text Encoder (Default W4A8)**:\n  [`qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_moss_image_sft_w4a8_gptq.safetensors)\n- **VAE**:\n  [`flux2-vae.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/blob/main/vae/moss_image_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\n#### ⚡ 8-Steps Turbo LoRA (optional):\n- [lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd/blob/main/lora.safetensors)\n- *Location*: `ComfyUI/models/loras/` *(Tip: Rename `lora.safetensors` to `moss_image_sft_8steps_dmd.safetensors`)*\n- *Usage*: steps is 8\n\n```text\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   ├── moss_image_base_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   │   ├── moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   └── moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │   └── lora.safetensors (or moss_image_sft_8steps_dmd.safetensors)\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├── qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors\n│   │   └── qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\nSimplified workflow by [HissingCat](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/MOSS-Image-SFT-8-steps-dmd/blob/main/lora.safetensors), based on Kijai's workflow."
      },
